    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in a dim, abandoned underground laboratory, the air thick with dust and the faint hum of ancient machinery. The reinforced steel doors are sealed shut, and the only light comes from the flickering glow of long-forgotten monitors. Your objective is to reactivate the facility's main mainframe to unlock the exit and escape this subterranean trap. Surrounding you are scattered clues, locked archives, and dormant terminals left behind by the mysterious researchers who once worked here. Every workstation seems to be part of a larger, convoluted security system designed to protect their most crucial findings. You'll need to piece together their secrets, trace the digital labyrinth they left behind, and figure out exactly how these strange mechanisms interact with one another. Time is ticking, and the ambient temperature is slowly dropping. You must navigate through the fragmented data and mechanical locks before the backup power completely fails.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
  },
